1
00:00:00,475 --> 00:00:04,015
(Sheldon:)I read they were illegally squatting
on Indian land.

2
00:00:06,013 --> 00:00:10,323
(Sheldon:)Personally, I think what we did
to the Native Americans was wrong,

3
00:00:10,384 --> 00:00:12,954
(Sheldon:)but this is your favourite show,
not mine.

4
00:00:13,855 --> 00:00:18,535
(Sheldon:)Oh, look at little Laura Ingalls,
eating that peanut butter sandwich.

5
00:00:18,659 --> 00:00:19,999
(Sheldon:)Peanut butter?

6
00:00:20,161 --> 00:00:21,471
(Raj:)Huh...

7
00:00:22,663 --> 00:00:24,473
(Sheldon:)That's strange,

8
00:00:24,532 --> 00:00:28,002
(Sheldon:)since peanut butter wasn't introduced
until the early 1900s.

9
00:00:30,538 --> 00:00:32,748
(Sheldon:)If I knew this show was
about time travel,

10
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:34,750
(Sheldon:)I would have watched it much sooner.

11
00:00:36,244 --> 00:00:38,024
(TURNS OFF TV)

12
00:00:38,212 --> 00:00:39,812
(Amy:)You're trying to get back at me

13
00:00:39,847 --> 00:00:41,557
(Amy:)for what I said
about Raiders of the Lust Ark.

14
00:00:41,649 --> 00:00:43,389
(Sheldon:)That's silly.

15
00:00:43,518 --> 00:00:46,088
(Sheldon:)Almost as silly as Dr. Baker
having a telephone,

16
00:00:46,187 --> 00:00:49,257
(Sheldon:)since telephones only existed
in large cities at that time.

17
00:00:49,857 --> 00:00:52,497
(Sheldon:)This is more like Little House
on the Preposterous.

18
00:00:53,928 --> 00:00:56,568
(Amy:)Sheldon, we're in a relationship.

19
00:00:56,731 --> 00:00:59,111
(Amy:)When you get angry, just tell me.

20
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:01,020
(Amy:)You don't need to seek revenge.

